  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n2.5 × 0.7\n\n3.5 × 0.6\n\n4.5 × 0.8\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\nSum of products = (a × b) + (c × d) + (e × f)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n2.5 × 0.7 + 3.5 × 0.6 + 4.5 × 0.8\n\n⇒ 2.5 × 0.7 = 1.75\n\n⇒ 3.5 × 0.6 = 2.1\n\n⇒ 4.5 × 0.8 = 3.6\n\nSum of products = 1.75 + 2.1 + 3.6\n\n⇒ 1.75 + 2.1 + 3.6 = 7.45\n\n**The value of 2.5 × 0.7 + 3.5 × 0.6 + 4.5 × 0.8 is 7.45.**",
